  m_text: You play as a magnificent Jack who must get to another planet. To do this,
    he must replenish his fuel, which is constantly running out. He is given fuel
    for the right turns that come his way. By turning the character to the left and
    right with the buttons, he will be able to complete the task and get fuel. The
    more precise the turn, the more fuel you will get.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
